    {
      "source": "Couchbase supports <a href=\"https://docs.couchbase.com/server/current/learn/data/transactions.html\">Distributed Transactions</a>. This section documents how to use it with Spring Data Couchbase.",
      "translation": "Couchbase 支持<a href=\"https://docs.couchbase.com/server/current/learn/data/transactions.html\">分布式事务</a>。本节介绍如何使用它与 Spring Data Couchbase 配合。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The entity class must have an <code>@Version Long</code> property to hold the CAS value of the document.",
      "translation": "实体类必须包含一个 `<code>@Version Long</code>` 属性，用于存储文档的 CAS 值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Couchbase Transactions are normally leveraged with a method annotated with @Transactional.\nThe @Transactional operator is implemented with the CouchbaseTransactionManager which is supplied as a bean in the AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration.\nCouchbase Transactions can be used without defining a service class by using CouchbaseTransactionOperator which is also supplied as a bean in AbtractCouchbaseConfiguration.\nCouchbase Transactions can also be used directly using Spring Data Couchbase operations within a lambda <a href=\"https://docs.couchbase.com/server/current/learn/data/transactions.html#using-transactions\">Using Transactions</a>",
      "translation": "Couchbase 事务通常通过带有 @Transactional 注解的方法来使用。@Transactional 操作符由 CouchbaseTransactionManager 实现，该管理器作为 Bean 提供在 AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration 中。  \n即使不定义服务类，也可以通过 CouchbaseTransactionOperator 使用 Couchbase 事务，该操作符同样作为 Bean 提供在 AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration 中。  \n此外，还可以直接在 Spring Data Couchbase 操作的 lambda 表达式中使用 Couchbase 事务 <a href=\"https://docs.couchbase.com/server/current/learn/data/transactions.html#using-transactions\">使用事务</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Please see the <a href=\"https://docs.couchbase.com/java-sdk/current/howtos/distributed-acid-transactions-from-the-sdk.html\">Reference Documentation</a>",
      "translation": "请参见<a href=\"https://docs.couchbase.com/java-sdk/current/howtos/distributed-acid-transactions-from-the-sdk.html\">参考文档</a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Couchbase Server 6.6.1 or above.",
      "translation": "Couchbase Server 6.6.1 或更高版本。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Couchbase 5.0.0-M5 or above.",
      "translation": "Spring Data Couchbase 5.0.0-M5 及以上版本。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "NTP should be configured so nodes of the Couchbase cluster are in sync with time. The time being out of sync will not cause incorrect behavior, but can impact metadata cleanup.",
      "translation": "应配置 NTP，以确保 Couchbase 集群中的节点时间同步。虽然时间不同步不会导致错误行为，但可能会影响元数据清理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The Spring Data Couchbase template operations insert, find, replace and delete and repository methods that use those calls can participate in a Couchbase Transaction. They can be executed in a transaction by using the @Transactional annotation, the CouchbaseTransactionalOperator, or in the lambda of a Couchbase Transaction.",
      "translation": "Spring Data Couchbase 模板操作（insert、find、replace 和 delete）以及使用这些调用的仓库方法可以参与 Couchbase 事务。可以通过使用@Transactional 注解、CouchbaseTransactionalOperator，或在 Couchbase Transaction 的 lambda 表达式中执行这些操作以在事务中运行它们。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "@Transactional defines as transactional a method or all methods on a class.",
      "translation": "@Transactional 用于将方法或类上的所有方法定义为事务。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When this annotation is declared at the class level, it applies as a default\nto all methods of the declaring class and its subclasses.",
      "translation": "当此注解在类级别声明时，它作为默认值应用于声明类及其所有子类的所有方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "[[-attribute-semantics]]\n===  Attribute Semantics",
      "translation": "[[属性语义]]\n=== 属性语义 ===",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In this release, the Couchbase Transactions ignores the rollback attributes.\nThe transaction isolation level is read-committed;",
      "translation": "在本版本中，Couchbase 事务会忽略回滚属性。\n事务隔离级别为读已提交；",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the body of @Transactional methods can be re-executed if the transaction fails.\nIt is imperative that everthing in the method body be idempotent.",
      "translation": "请注意，如果事务失败，@Transactional 方法的主体可能会被重新执行。因此，方法体中的所有内容必须是幂等的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Functioning of the  @Transactional method annotation requires",
      "translation": "@Transactional 方法注解的功能需要",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the configuration class to be annotated with @EnableTransactionManagement;",
      "translation": "需要添加@EnableTransactionManagement 注解的配置类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the service object with the annotated methods must be annotated with @Service;",
      "translation": "带有注解方法的 Service 对象必须使用@Service 进行注解；",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the body of the method is executed in a transaction.",
      "translation": "该方法体在事务中执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the service object with the annotated methods must be obtained via @Autowired.",
      "translation": "带有注解方法的 Service 对象必须通过 @Autowired 获取。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the call to the method must be made from a different class than service because calling an annotated\nmethod from the same class will not invoke the Method Interceptor that does the transaction processing.",
      "translation": "调用该方法必须来自与 Service 不同的类，因为从同一类中调用已标注的方法不会触发执行事务处理的 Method Interceptor。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "CouchbaseTransactionalOperator can be used to construct a transaction in-line without creating a service class that uses @Transactional.\nCouchbaseTransactionalOperator is available as a bean and can be instantiated with @Autowired.\nIf creating one explicitly, it must be created with CouchbaseTransactionalOperator.create(manager) (NOT TransactionalOperator.create(manager)).",
      "translation": "CouchbaseTransactionalOperator 可用于在不创建使用 @Transactional 注解的服务类的情况下，内联构建事务。  \nCouchbaseTransactionalOperator 可作为 Bean 提供，并使用 @Autowired 进行实例化。  \n如果显式创建该对象，必须通过 CouchbaseTransactionalOperator.create(manager) 方法创建（而非 TransactionalOperator.create(manager)）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Couchbase works seamlessly with the Couchbase Java SDK for transaction processing. Spring Data Couchbase operations that\ncan be executed in a transaction will work directly within the lambda of a transactions().run() without involving any of the Spring\nTransactions mechanisms. This is the most straight-forward way to leverage Couchbase Transactions in Spring Data Couchbase.",
      "translation": "Spring Data Couchbase 与 Couchbase Java SDK 在事务处理方面无缝集成。能够以事务方式执行的 Spring Data Couchbase 操作，可直接在 transactions().run() 的 lambda 表达式中运行，无需涉及任何 Spring 事务机制。这是在 Spring Data Couchbase 中利用 Couchbase 事务的最直接方式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
